      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115IRP0.                                             00050000
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Related_Party.    00070000
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00100000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210003
      *                                                                 00220003
      *    Initialize                          R115IRP0-Related-Party   00230003
      *    Set   R115IRP0-Version        To    True                     00240003
      *    Set   R115IRP0-In-Select      To    True                     00250003
      *                                                                 00260003
      * One of these:                                                   00270012
      * 1) Set   R115IRP0-In-Actual      To    True                     00280012
      * 2) Set   R115IRP0-In-Work        To    True                     00290012
      *                                                                 00300012
      * One of these:                                                   00310003
      * 1) Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00320003
      * 2) Move  &fin-inst-no            To    R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-No  00330003
      *                                                                 00340003
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IRP0-In-Contract-Type00350003
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IRP0-In-Contract-No  00360003
      *    Move  &role-type              To    R115IRP0-In-Role-Type    00370007
      *                                                                 00380003
      * To specify relation to Main_Contract or Part_Amount:            00390007
      * One of these: (3rd only for cursors)                            00400007
      * 1) Set   R115IRP0-In-Rel-MC      To    True                     00410007
      * 2) Set   R115IRP0-In-Rel-PA      To    True                     00420007
      * 3) Set   R115IRP0-In-Rel-All     To    True                     00430007
      *                                                                 00440007
      * If you want Related Party for a Part_Amount, fill in these:     00450007
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115IRP0-In-CA-Currency  00460007
      *    Move  &part-amount seq.no     To    R115IRP0-In-PA-Seq-No    00470007
      *                                                                 00480007
      *    Call  'F115IRP0'              Using R115IRP0-Related-Party   00490003
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00500003
      *    End-Call                                                     00510003
      *                                                                 00520003
      *    Evaluate True                                                00530003
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00540003
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00550003
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00560003
      *                                                                 00570003
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00580003
      *        ...not found...                                          00590003
      *                                                                 00600003
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00610003
      *        ...found...                                              00620003
      *                                                                 00630003
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00640003
      *                                                                 00650003
      *################################################################*00660000
