      *################################################################*00790000
      *                                                                 00800000
         03  R115IRP0-Related-Party.                                    00810000
      *                                                                 00820000
           05  R115IRP0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00830000
             88  R115IRP0-Version                    Value '20000619'.  00840020
      *                                                                 00850000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00860000
      *                                                                 00870000
           05  R115IRP0-Qualification.                                  00880000
      *                                                                 00890000
             10  R115IRP0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00900000
               88  R115IRP0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00910000
               88  R115IRP0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00920000
               88  R115IRP0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00930000
               88  R115IRP0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00940000
               88  R115IRP0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00950000
               88  R115IRP0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00960000
      *                                                                 00970000
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00980000
      * depending on the need.                                          00990000
      *                                                                 01000000
      * In-Table must be set whatever the desired action is.            01010012
      *                                                                 01020012
      * For Insert, use the Data area for all fields.                   01030009
      *                                                                 01040009
      * For Select, Update and Delete, use:                             01050009
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                01060000
      *     - Contract-Type                                             01070000
      *     - Contract-No                                               01080000
      *     - Relation (Rel-MC or Rel-PA)                               01090007
      *     - If Rel-PA is specified:                                   01100007
      *       - Currency                                                01110007
      *       - Part Amount Sequence Number                             01120007
      *     - Role-Type                                                 01130007
      *                                                                 01140000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           01150000
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      01160000
      *     - Optional: Contract-Type                                   01170000
      *     - Optional: Contract-No                                     01180020
      *     - If Rel-PA is specified:                                   01190007
      *       - Optional: Currency and Part Amount Seq.no               01200007
      *     - Optional: Role-Type                                       01210007
      *     - Optional: Customer-No or Customer-ID                      01220018
      *                                                                 01230000
             10  R115IRP0-In-Key.                                       01240000
      *                                                                 01250000
               15  R115IRP0-In-Table-Version    Pic  X(16).             01260013
                 88  R115IRP0-In-Actual              Value 'ACTUAL'.    01270012
                 88  R115IRP0-In-Work                Value 'WORK'.      01280012
      *                                                                 01290012
      *        It is optional wether you use Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID.01300000
               15  R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst.                                01310000
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-No    Pic  X(18).             01320002
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01330000
      *                                                                 01340000
      *        Contract-Type and -No is mandatory for                   01350000
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01360009
               15  R115IRP0-In-Contract.                                01370000
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).             01380000
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01390000
      *                                                                 01400000
      *          Temporary, as this field is still in use.              01410020
                 20  R115IRP0-In-From-Contr-No  Redefines               01420020
                                                R115IRP0-In-Contract-No 01430020
                                                Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01440020
      *                                                                 01450020
      *        You need to specify wether you want Related_Party        01460008
      *        related to Main_Contract, Part_Amount or any.            01470007
      *        Rel-MC or Rel-PA must be specified for                   01480007
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01490009
               15  R115IRP0-In-Relation         Pic  X(02).             01500007
                 88  R115IRP0-In-Rel-MC              Value 'MC'.        01510007
                 88  R115IRP0-In-Rel-PA              Value 'PA'.        01520007
                 88  R115IRP0-In-Rel-Any             Value '* ', '  '.  01530007
      *                                                                 01540007
      *        These fields are only relevant if Rel-PA is specified.   01550007
      *        They are both mandatory for Select/Update/Delete.        01560009
               15  R115IRP0-In-Part-Amount.                             01570007
                 20  R115IRP0-In-CA-Currency    Pic  X(03).             01580007
                 20  R115IRP0-In-PA-Seq-No      Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01590007
      *                                                                 01600007
      *        Role is mandatory for Select/Update/Delete.              01610009
               15  R115IRP0-In-Role.                                    01620003
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Role-Type      Pic  X(05).             01630003
      *                                                                 01640000
      *        Customer is optional for Get-1st/-Next, and not in use   01650018
      *        for other actions.                                       01660018
      *        It is optional wether you use Customer-No or Customer-ID.01670018
               15  R115IRP0-In-Customer.                                01680018
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Customer-No    Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01690018
                 20  R115IRP0-In-Customer-ID    Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01700018
      *                                                                 01701024
      *                                                                 01710018
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01720000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01730000
      *                                                                 01740000
             10  R115IRP0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01750000
               88  R115IRP0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01760016
      *                                                                 01770000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01780000
      *                                                                 01790000
           05  R115IRP0-Data.                                           01800000
      *                                                                 01810000
             10  R115IRP0-Key.                                          01820000
               15  R115IRP0-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01830000
               15  R115IRP0-Contract-ID.                                01840000
                 20  R115IRP0-Contract-Type     Pic  X(03).             01850000
                 20  R115IRP0-Contract-No       Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01860000
      *                                                                 01870007
      *      These fields are only relevant if Rel-PA is specified.     01880007
               15  R115IRP0-Part-Amount.                                01890007
                 20  R115IRP0-CA-Currency       Pic  X(03).             01900007
                 20  R115IRP0-PA-Seq-No         Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01910007
      *                                                                 01920007
               15  R115IRP0-Role-Type           Pic  X(05).             01930007
      *                                                                 01940000
      *      This code defines wether the Related_Party is related to   01950008
      *      the main contract or a part amount.                        01960007
             10  R115IRP0-Relation              Pic  X(02).             01970007
               88  R115IRP0-Rel-MC                   Value 'MC'.        01980007
               88  R115IRP0-Rel-PA                   Value 'PA'.        01990007
      *                                                                 02000007
      *      If the related party is located in FD Customer,            02010004
      *      the Customer-ID will be populated.                         02020006
      *      The Customer-No will be populated regardless of where      02030006
      *      the customer is populated.                                 02040006
      *      On insert and update, you may use the Customer-ID if known,02050006
      *      or you may use the Customer-No.                            02060006
             10  R115IRP0-Customer.                                     02070004
               15  R115IRP0-Customer-ID         Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.02080005
               15  R115IRP0-Customer-No         Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.02090005
