      *                                                                 02160014
             10  R115IRP0-Account-2             Pic  X(35).             02170007
             10  R115IRP0-NOR-Account-2   Redefines R115IRP0-Account-2  02180014
                                                Pic  9(11).             02190014
      *                                                                 02200014
             10  R115IRP0-Reference             Pic  X(16).             02210001
