      *                                                                 02290001
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    02300000
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            02310000
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   02320000
      * each Get-Next.                                                  02330000
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           02340000
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       02350000
      * that complies with your qualification.                          02360000
      *                                                                 02370000
             10  R115IRP0-Out-Accumulators.                             02380000
               15  R115IRP0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.02390000
               15  R115IRP0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.02400000
